# AI Elements (in @engenty/ai-ui)

Chat presentation components live in **`packages/ai-ui/src/components/ai-elements/`** — not `ui-core`. Product chat uses **AG-UI**, not Vercel AI SDK `useChat`.

## Location

- `packages/ai-ui/src/components/ai-elements/` (e.g. `message.tsx` — `Message`, `MessageContent`, `MessageResponse`)
- Copilot shell: `packages/ai-ui/src/components/copilot/`

## Usage

Import from `@engenty/ai-ui` (product shell) or `@engenty/ai-ui/embed` (module embeds):

```tsx
import {
  Message,
  MessageContent,
  MessageResponse,
} from "@engenty/ai-ui/embed";
```

Generic primitives (`Button`, `Card`, …) still come from `@engenty/ui-core`.

## Adding components

- Prefer copying/adapting from the [AI Elements registry](https://elements.ai-sdk.dev/docs) into `ai-ui`, with relative imports to `ui-core` primitives.
- Export from `packages/ai-ui` and run `pnpm --filter @engenty/ai-ui build`.
- See [agent-ui-runtime.md](../../../packages/app-shell/docs/agent-ui-registration.md) for package boundaries.
